    <system:String x:Key="BW_BlockConfirm" xml:space="preserve">Block all internet access for {0}?&#x0a;&#x0a;• Live connections are cut immediately&#x0a;• A Windows Firewall rule stops new connections (even after WinXTools is closed)&#x0a;&#x0a;Unblock it later with the same button or from Bandwidth Control.</system:String>
